SUMMARY:Resource Command — Building on the G-Factor (Kennedy Thebe & Ian Mwiinga, ZEITI)
DESCRIPTION:Call between Kennedy Thebe (Kgosi Sovereign Holdings\, Resource Command) and Ian Mwiinga (Zambia Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative).\n\nAgenda:\n• Methodological alignment between RC's zero-knowledge royalty proof and the ZEITI G-Factor framework\n• Walkthrough of the cryptographic primitive in plain English (audit-envelope metaphor)\n• Discussion of a 90-day Zambia pilot (methodology integration → historical replay → live pilot)\n• ZEITI Secretariat methodology note pathway\n\nOne-page pre-read brief will be delivered 3–4 days ahead of the call.\n\nSoft channel: WhatsApp +260 972 078 085\n\nContact: Kennedy Thebe\, Principal\, Kgosi Sovereign Holdings.
